---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Cookies and Browser Storage | HeyDock" description="What the HeyDock website uses in your browser. This site does not set advertising or analytics cookies in its own HTML, CSS or JavaScript." canonicalPath="/cookies">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Cookies and storage</p>
    <h1>What this website uses in your browser</h1>
    <p class="lede">A factual description of cookies and storage based on the current generated site and documented hosting model.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section white"><div class="wrap prose">
    <h2>What our pages do</h2>
    <p>The HeyDock HTML, CSS and JavaScript in this repository do not set advertising or analytics cookies and do not write enquiry fields to <code>localStorage</code> or <code>sessionStorage</code>.</p>
    <p>Any in-page filters operate in the current page document only. Custom select disclosures, if present, are progressive enhancements around native form controls.</p>
    <h2>What may still occur</h2>
    <p>Cloudflare Pages (the intended production host) may set or rely on cookies or similar technologies that are strictly necessary for security, load balancing or platform operation. Those behaviours are controlled by Cloudflare and should be re-checked on the live production hostname after deployment.</p>
    <p>Private preview or sign-in gateways used during development are separate from the public Pages deployment and may use their own authentication cookies. They are not part of the intended public visitor experience.</p>
    <h2>If we add optional cookies later</h2>
    <p>If analytics or non-essential cookies are introduced later, this page and any required consent mechanism must be updated before those technologies are enabled. This site does not add an analytics product or cookie banner.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
